<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>토리든 다이브인 저분자 히알루론산 세럼</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        torriden: {
                            50: '#e6f4ff',
                            100: '#bae0ff',
                            500: '#00A3FF',
                            600: '#0082cc',
                            700: '#006699',
                            900: '#00334d'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'Pretendard', 'sans-serif']
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <!-- Google Fonts Pretendard -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Three.js Import Map -->
    <script type="importmap">
        {
            "imports": {
                "three": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.160.0/build/three.module.js",
                "three/addons/": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.160.0/examples/jsm/"
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; }
        #product-3d-canvas {
            touch-action: none;
            cursor: grab;
        }
        #product-3d-canvas:active {
            cursor: grabbing;
        }
        #game-3d-canvas {
            touch-action: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        @keyframes twinklePop {
            0% { transform: scale(0.4) rotate(-8deg); opacity: 0; }
            60% { transform: scale(1.12) rotate(3deg); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .animate-twinkle-pop {
            animation: twinklePop 0.65s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) forwards;
        }
        @keyframes shake {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
            25% { transform: translateX(-6px); }
            75% { transform: translateX(6px); }
        }
        .animate-shake {
            animation: shake 0.3s ease-in-out;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-gray-800 antialiased selection:bg-torriden-500 selection:text-white">

    <!-- Navigation Header -->
    <header class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-white/85 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-gray-100 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <!-- Official Torriden Brand Mark -->
            <a href="#hero" class="flex items-center space-x-2.5 group" aria-label="토리든 공식 브랜드 홈">
                <svg class="h-8 w-auto" viewBox="0 0 186 38" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Torriden 공식 로고">
                    <!-- Torriden Iconic Square Frame Symbol -->
                    <rect x="2" y="3" width="32" height="32" rx="4" stroke="#00A3FF" stroke-width="2.6"/>
                    <rect x="7.5" y="8.5" width="21" height="21" rx="2" stroke="#bae0ff" stroke-width="1.4"/>
                    <circle cx="18" cy="19" r="4.2" fill="#00A3FF"/>
                    <!-- Official Torriden Wordmark -->
                    <text x="44" y="27.5" fill="#090D16" font-family="Pretendard, Inter, -apple-system, sans-serif" font-size="25" font-weight="800" letter-spacing="-0.8">Torriden</text>
                </svg>
                <span class="hidden sm:inline-block h-4 w-px bg-gray-200"></span>
                <span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-torriden-600 font-bold hidden sm:inline-block">DIVE IN</span>
            </a>

            <nav class="hidden lg:flex items-center space-x-7 text-sm font-medium text-gray-600">
                <a href="#hero" class="hover:text-torriden-500 transition-colors">3D 제품보기</a>
                <a href="#game" class="hover:text-torriden-500 transition-colors font-bold text-torriden-600">3D 미니게임</a>
                <a href="#empathy" class="hover:text-torriden-500 transition-colors">피부고민</a>
                <a href="#features" class="hover:text-torriden-500 transition-colors">핵심성분</a>
                <a href="#proof" class="hover:text-torriden-500 transition-colors">어워드&후기</a>
            </nav>

            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
                <button onclick="openProductsModal()" class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center space-x-1.5 bg-white hover:bg-torriden-50 text-gray-700 hover:text-torriden-600 border border-gray-200 hover:border-torriden-200 font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm transition-all">
                    <span>다른 제품 보러가기</span>
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
                </button>
                <button onclick="openModal()" class="bg-torriden-500 hover:bg-torriden-600 text-white font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm shadow-lg shadow-torriden-500/20 transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0">
                    구매하기
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main>
        <!-- 1. Hero Section (3D Product Viewer) -->
        <section id="hero" class="relative pt-28 pb-20 md:pt-36 md:pb-28 bg-gradient-to-b from-torriden-50/50 via-white to-white overflow-hidden">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                    <div class="space-y-6 text-center md:text-left">
                        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-torriden-100 text-torriden-700 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide">
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 2a8 8 0 100 16 8 8 0 000-16zm1 11H9v-2h2v2zm0-4H9V5h2v4z"/></svg>
                            <span>올영 1위* 저분자 히알루론산 세럼</span>
                        </div>
                        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
                            피부가 마시는<br>
                            가장 깊은 수분,<br>
                            <span class="text-torriden-500">3초 속보습</span>
                        </h1>
                        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-lg mx-auto md:mx-0">
                            속당김 없이 촘촘하게 채워지는 5D 복합 저분자 히알루론산의 청량한 수분 진정 솔루션을 3D로 직접 살펴보고 체험해보세요.
                        </p>
                        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-3 pt-4">
                            <button onclick="openModal()" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-torriden-500 hover:bg-torriden-600 text-white font-semibold px-7 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-xl shadow-torriden-500/30 transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 text-base">
                                지금 바로 구매하기
                            </button>
                            <a href="#game" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-torriden-50 text-torriden-700 hover:bg-torriden-100 font-bold px-6 py-4 rounded-xl border border-torriden-200 transition-all text-center flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
                                <span>💧</span>
                                <span>3D 세럼 바르기 게임</span>
                            </a>
                            <button onclick="openProductsModal()" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 text-gray-700 hover:text-torriden-600 font-bold px-6 py-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-torriden-300 shadow-sm transition-all flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
                                <span>토리든의 다른 제품 보러가기</span>
                                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Interactive 3D Product Viewer -->
                    <div class="relative flex justify-center">
                        <div class="absolute w-80 h-80 bg-torriden-100 rounded-full blur-3xl -z-10 opacity-70 animate-pulse"></div>
                        <div class="relative w-full max-w-md aspect-[4/5] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f4f6f8] via-[#eef3f7] to-[#e6edf3] rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border border-white/80 overflow-hidden">
                            <!-- Top Badges -->
                            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 z-10 flex items-center space-x-1.5 bg-white/85 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-torriden-600 shadow-sm pointer-events-none">
                                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-torriden-500 animate-ping"></span>
                                <span>3D PRODUCT VIEW</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 z-10 bg-white/85 backdrop-blur-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-torriden-700 shadow-sm pointer-events-none">
                                50ml / 1.69 fl. oz.
                            </div>

                            <!-- 3D Canvas Container -->
                            <div id="viewer-container" class="w-full h-full relative">
                                <div id="viewer-loading" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-torriden-700 text-sm font-medium bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-sm z-20 transition-opacity duration-300">
                                    <div class="w-8 h-8 border-4 border-torriden-200 border-t-torriden-500 rounded-full animate-spin mb-2"></div>
                                    <span>3D 제품 불러오는 중...</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Bottom Controls Bar -->
                            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 z-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
                                <div class="bg-white/85 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-600 shadow-sm pointer-events-none flex items-center space-x-1">
                                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-torriden-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/></svg>
                                    <span>드래그 회전 · 휠 확대</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                                    <button id="btn-toggle-cap" type="button" class="bg-white/90 hover:bg-torriden-500 hover:text-white text-torriden-700 text-[11px] font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm transition-colors">
                                        스포이드 열기
                                    </button>
                                    <button id="btn-toggle-rotate" type="button" class="bg-white/90 hover:bg-torriden-500 hover:text-white text-gray-700 text-[11px] font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm transition-colors">
                                        자동회전 ON
                                    </button>
                                    <button id="btn-reset-view" type="button" class="bg-white/90 hover:bg-gray-900 hover:text-white text-gray-700 text-[11px] font-bold px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-full shadow-sm transition-colors">
                                        초기화
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Interactive 3D Skincare Mini-Game Section -->
        <section id="game" class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-torriden-50/40 to-gray-50">
            <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="text-center mb-10">
                    <span class="inline-block bg-torriden-100 text-torriden-700 font-bold text-xs tracking-widest uppercase px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full mb-3">
                        3D SKINCARE MINI GAME
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">
                        직접 뚜껑을 열고 <span class="text-torriden-500">촉촉한 수분</span>을 채워보세요!
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm sm:text-base">
                        먼저 토리든 세럼의 뚜껑을 클릭해 연 다음, 눈과 입술을 피해 웃는 얼굴 구석구석 세럼을 발라주세요.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Game Cabinet -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-stretch">
                    <!-- 3D Game Stage -->
                    <div class="lg:col-span-8 relative bg-gradient-to-b from-[#dbeeff] via-[#eef7ff] to-[#f8fbff] rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border-2 border-white overflow-hidden min-h-[480px] sm:min-h-[560px]">
                        <!-- Top HUD -->
                        <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 right-4 z-20 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pointer-events-none">
                            <div id="game-step-badge" class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-2 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-torriden-100 flex items-center space-x-2">
                                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-torriden-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                                <span id="game-step-text" class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-gray-800">
                                    STEP 1. 오른쪽 아래 세럼 뚜껑을 클릭해서 열어주세요!
                                </span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md px-4 py-2 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-torriden-100 flex items-center space-x-3">
                                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">수분 충전</span>
                                <div class="w-24 sm:w-32 h-2.5 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                                    <div id="game-progress-bar" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-torriden-500 to-cyan-400 rounded-full transition-all duration-150" style="width: 0%;"></div>
                                </div>
                                <span id="game-progress-text" class="text-xs font-black text-torriden-600 w-9 text-right">0%</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Warning Toast (Eyes / Lips) -->
                        <div id="game-warning-toast" class="absolute top-20 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-30 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-full shadow-lg opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-200 whitespace-nowrap">
                            ⚠️ 눈과 입술은 피해서 발라주세요!
                        </div>

                        <!-- 3D Canvas Host -->
                        <div id="game-container" class="w-full h-full min-h-[480px] sm:min-h-[560px] relative"></div>

                        <!-- Step 1 Floating Hint on Bottle -->
                        <div id="cap-click-hint" class="absolute bottom-20 right-6 sm:right-10 z-20 pointer-events-none animate-bounce">
                            <div class="bg-torriden-500 text-white text-xs font-extrabold px-3.5 py-2 rounded-full shadow-lg">
                                👇 여기 뚜껑 클릭!
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Victory Overlay: "Twinkle!" -->
                        <div id="game-win-overlay" class="absolute inset-0 z-40 bg-torriden-900/35 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-6 opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-300">
                            <div id="game-win-card" class="bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-3xl p-8 max-w-sm w-full text-center shadow-2xl border-2 border-torriden-200">
                                <div class="text-4xl mb-2">✨💧✨</div>
                                <div class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-torriden-500 via-cyan-400 to-blue-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent mb-3">
                                    Twinkle!
                                </div>
                                <p class="text-gray-800 font-bold text-lg mb-1">속보습 100% 충전 완료!</p>
                                <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs sm:text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                                    눈과 입술을 피해 얼굴 구석구석<br>토리든 다이브인 세럼을 완벽하게 발랐어요!
                                </p>
                                <div class="flex space-x-2.5">
                                    <button id="btn-game-replay" type="button" class="flex-1 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-800 font-bold py-3 rounded-xl text-sm transition-colors">
                                        다시 하기
                                    </button>
                                    <button onclick="openModal()" type="button" class="flex-1 bg-torriden-500 hover:bg-torriden-600 text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-xl text-sm shadow-lg shadow-torriden-500/30 transition-colors">
                                        제품 구매하기
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Right Status & Checklist Panel -->
                    <div class="lg:col-span-4 bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
                        <div class="space-y-5">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold text-gray-900">미션 체크리스트</h3>
                                <button id="btn-game-reset" type="button" class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 hover:text-torriden-600 bg-gray-100 hover:bg-torriden-50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full transition-colors">
                                    게임 초기화
                                </button>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Step Progress List -->
                            <div class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
                                <div id="chk-cap" class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-2xl bg-torriden-50/70 border border-torriden-100 transition-colors">
                                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
                                        <span class="chk-icon w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-white text-torriden-500 font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm">1</span>
                                        <span class="font-bold text-gray-800">세럼 뚜껑 열기</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="chk-status text-xs font-bold text-torriden-500">대기중</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div>
                                <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2.5">얼굴 부위별 세럼 도포 (눈·입술 제외)</p>
                                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 text-xs">
                                    <div id="zone-forehead" class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 transition-all">
                                        <span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">이마</span>
                                        <span class="zone-badge text-gray-400 font-bold">0%</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="zone-nose" class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 transition-all">
                                        <span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">콧등</span>
                                        <span class="zone-badge text-gray-400 font-bold">0%</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="zone-leftCheek" class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 transition-all">
                                        <span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">왼쪽 볼</span>
                                        <span class="zone-badge text-gray-400 font-bold">0%</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="zone-rightCheek" class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 transition-all">
                                        <span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">오른쪽 볼</span>
                                        <span class="zone-badge text-gray-400 font-bold">0%</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div id="zone-chin" class="col-span-2 flex items-center justify-between p-3 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 transition-all">
                                        <span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">턱 & 턱선</span>
                                        <span class="zone-badge text-gray-400 font-bold">0%</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-torriden-50 rounded-2xl p-4 text-xs text-torriden-900 space-y-1.5 border border-torriden-100">
                            <p class="font-extrabold text-torriden-700">💡 플레이 팁</p>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                                뚜껑을 연 뒤 마우스(또는 손가락)를 누른 채로 얼굴 위를 천천히 문질러 보세요. 파란 세럼 방울이 얼굴에 발리며 피부가 반짝이는 물광으로 변합니다!
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Problem & Empathy Section -->
        <section id="empathy" class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
                <span class="text-torriden-500 font-bold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">SKIN CONCERN</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mt-2 mb-4">
                    혹시 이런 피부 고민을 가지고 계신가요?
                </h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
                    아무리 바깥에 크림을 덧발라도 속에서부터 느껴지는 건조함과 들뜨는 메이크업, 원인은 바로 '진짜 속보습'의 부족입니다.
                </p>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow flex flex-col items-center text-center">
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-torriden-50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-torriden-500 mb-6">
